			<item>
				<title>SnapSweeper - Prototype &amp; Development Process</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/home/posts/snapsweeper/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/home/posts/snapsweeper/</guid>
				<description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;snapsweeperHS.png&#34; alt=&#34;SafeBite Home Screen&#34; width=&#34;250&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;SafeBite Home Screen&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;snapsweeper-design&#34;&gt;SnapSweeper Design&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#snapsweeper-design&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;photos-videos-it-all-adds-up-keep-swiping-and-earn-achievements&#34;&gt;Photos. Videos. It All Adds Up. Keep Swiping and Earn Achievements.&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#photos-videos-it-all-adds-up-keep-swiping-and-earn-achievements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;PhotoSwipe provides an easy to use interface, showing you where you have the most media and helping you declutter fast. As you continue to use SnapSweeper, you’ll unlock more achievements. Keep exploring the app to find more!&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;snapsweeperAchievements.png&#34; alt=&#34;SnapSweeper Achievements Screen&#34; width=&#34;500&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;SnapSweeper Achievements Screen&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;photoswipe&#34;&gt;PhotoSwipe&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#photoswipe&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Featured in SnapSweeper, PhotoSwipe allows you to act fast on your photo library. Swipe left to mark an item for deletion. A swipe in the right direction moves on to the next piece. Take advantage of the beautiful Liquid Glass redesign available on devices running iOS 26 or later.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>SafeBite - Prototype &amp; Development Process</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/home/posts/safebite/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/home/posts/safebite/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;introducing-safebite&#34;&gt;Introducing SafeBite&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#introducing-safebite&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Encountered an allergen at a restaurant? Save it to your places in SafeBtie and let others know about it!&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;SafeBiteHomeUpper.png&#34; alt=&#34;SafeBite Home Screen&#34; width=&#34;250&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;SafeBite Home Screen&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;aside class=&#34;callout callout--note&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;callout__icon&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;callout__text&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;callout__label&#34;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;callout__body&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supported Devices: iPhone 8 / iPhone 8 Plus or newer; iPhone X or newer&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;While a working concept of this app exists, it remains in a prototype stage. Read more about the development process and motivations towards this product!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
